sequenceDiagram
    participant M as NavigationMode / MissionController
    participant R as NavigationRuntimeNode
    participant W as PlanningWorker / Planner
    participant T as ExecutionTimelineStore
    participant P as PX4 setpoint interface
    M->>R: Goal message
    R->>W: PlanningKey / solve job
    W-->>R: Candidate result (not yet executable)
    R->>T: validate and commit or stage
    T-->>R: active/pending immutable timeline
    R->>T: due activation + sample + final exposure guard
    T-->>M: NavigationCommand message
    M->>M: command admission / cache
    M->>P: setpoint update input
    Note over M,P: PX4 command application is not observed by this source path.
